<i>Happy birthday, Ben.</i>

468
01:13:29.872 --> 01:13:32.039
<i>You want to blow out the candle?</i>

469
01:13:42.285 --> 01:13:44.118
Run, Benny, run!

470
01:13:50.627 --> 01:13:52.968
<font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHS)
(COUGHS)</font>

471
01:14:08.811 --> 01:14:10.945
<font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHING)</font>

472
01:14:20.056 --> 01:14:21.589
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOT)</font>

473
01:15:02.765 --> 01:15:04.765
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANS)</font>

474
01:15:10.773 --> 01:15:12.807
<font color="#D900D9">(HORN BLARING)</font>

475
01:15:39.368 --> 01:15:41.389
<font color="#D900D9">(FLY BUZZING)</font>

476
01:16:09.799 --> 01:16:11.832
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANS)</font>

477
01:16:17.874 --> 01:16:20.874
Your word against mine.

478
01:16:21.510 --> 01:16:23.444
I wonder who they'll believe.

479
01:16:26.115 --> 01:16:28.638
- Well, I guess we'll find out.
- <font color="#D900D9">(PHONE RINGING)</font>

480
01:16:35.424 --> 01:16:37.983
- You know anyone in China?
- <font color="#D900D9">(RINGING CONTINUES)</font>

481
01:16:42.732 --> 01:16:44.131
$1 million.

482
01:16:46.552 --> 01:16:48.102
Cash.

483
01:16:49.572 --> 01:16:53.108
PIN number is 1932...

484
01:16:53.668 --> 01:16:55.276
<font color="#D900D9">(PHONE CONTINUES RINGING)</font>

485
01:16:56.679 --> 01:16:58.546
You little prick.

486
01:17:12.962 --> 01:17:14.862
He shot Charlie.

487
01:17:16.199 --> 01:17:18.000
I've got the body in the car.

488
01:17:18.100 --> 01:17:22.068
I believe I have the right
to one phone call.

489
01:17:23.472 --> 01:17:27.006
Is there something
you're not telling me, Ben?

490
01:17:40.723 --> 01:17:42.423
Only about the money.

491
01:17:46.662 --> 01:17:49.879
I'm sorry, but I'm gonna have
to hold you while I talk with him.

492
01:17:49.979 --> 01:17:50.837
He's gonna lie.

493
01:17:50.937 --> 01:17:53.412
I'm sure he's gonna say
the same thing about you.

494
01:17:55.171 --> 01:17:57.571
Yeah, but I can't pay you to believe me.

495
01:18:20.096 --> 01:18:22.617
So how much did he offer you?

496
01:18:23.899 --> 01:18:25.205
One million.

497
01:18:28.838 --> 01:18:30.337
You're free to go.

498
01:18:52.261 --> 01:18:54.031
How's it feel, Ben?

499
01:19:01.770 --> 01:19:06.350
- How does what feel?
- Winning. First time, hmm?

500
01:19:07.510 --> 01:19:09.178
Could be your last.

501
01:19:09.926 --> 01:19:11.078
<font color="#D900D9">(SCOFFS)</font>

502
01:19:12.782 --> 01:19:14.383
Keeping you from a hot date?

503
01:19:14.483 --> 01:19:15.875
No, no, I'm just recording

504
01:19:15.975 --> 01:19:19.486
how long your deputy's
deprived me of my bathroom privileges.

505
01:19:21.457 --> 01:19:23.824
So I can tell my lawyer.

506
01:19:29.165 --> 01:19:30.397
Paul.

507
01:19:38.775 --> 01:19:40.943
<font color="#808080">WOMAN:</font> I just found a whole bunch of pictures.

508
01:19:41.143 --> 01:19:44.645
<font color="#808080">JOE:</font> "John Madec ships jobs to Asia."

509
01:19:47.817 --> 01:19:51.885
<font color="#808080">JOHN'S VOICE:</font> <i>Look at that sun, Ben.
It really likes you.</i>

510
01:19:53.022 --> 01:19:57.426
<i>I'm not killing you, Ben. I'm just gonna
watch you wander around for a while.</i>

511
01:19:57.526 --> 01:20:00.701
<i>We had a deal.
Where I come from, a deal is a deal.</i>

512
01:20:00.801 --> 01:20:03.732
<i>We shook hands, God damn it!</i>

513
01:20:03.832 --> 01:20:08.736
<i>That's a good choice, Ben. Now your life,
it's never going to be the same.</i>

514
01:20:13.876 --> 01:20:16.243
<font color="#D900D9">(HELICOPTER BLADES WHIRRING)</font>

515
01:20:40.436 --> 01:20:42.292
<font color="#808080">BEN:</font> Madec!

516
01:20:54.183 --> 01:20:55.449
Madec!

517
01:20:57.819 --> 01:20:59.420
Son of a bitch!

518
01:22:37.053 --> 01:22:38.587
What about your roommates?

519
01:22:39.187 --> 01:22:41.370
Let them listen.

520
01:22:50.566 --> 01:22:52.032
You won't go back?

521
01:23:01.010 --> 01:23:02.409
I love you.

522
01:23:12.621 --> 01:23:14.688
<font color="#D900D9">(CRICKETS CHIRPING)</font>

523
01:23:16.859 --> 01:23:18.891
<font color="#D900D9">(DOG BARKING)</font>

524
01:23:58.968 --> 01:24:01.057
<font color="#D900D9">(BEEPING)</font>

525
01:24:04.340 --> 01:24:06.040
<font color="#D900D9">(LOCK CLATTERS)</font>

526
01:25:00.796 --> 01:25:02.331
<font color="#D900D9">(GUN COCKS)</font>

527
01:25:02.631 --> 01:25:04.027
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

528
01:25:05.301 --> 01:25:07.397
<font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font>

529
01:25:14.977 --> 01:25:17.998
<font color="#808080">JOHN:</font> You thinking about me, Ben?

530
01:25:19.916 --> 01:25:22.983
I've been thinking about you.

531
01:25:27.323 --> 01:25:30.824
Sometimes you got to clean up
your own mess.

532
01:25:35.731 --> 01:25:37.655
You know, I, uh...

533
01:25:37.755 --> 01:25:41.668
just hope that you enjoy
your last victory.

534
01:25:42.805 --> 01:25:44.273
<font color="#D900D9">(GUN COCKS)</font>

535
01:25:44.373 --> 01:25:45.774
<font color="#D900D9">(SCREAMS)
(GUNSHOT)</font>

536
01:25:45.874 --> 01:25:47.040
<font color="#D900D9">(SHOTGUN FIRES)</font>

537
01:25:53.449 --> 01:25:54.950
<font color="#D900D9">(SCREAMS)
(GUNSHOT)</font>

538
01:25:55.050 --> 01:25:56.385
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANS)
(SHOTGUN FIRES)</font>

539
01:25:56.485 --> 01:25:58.919
<font color="#D900D9">(SHOTGUN CLATTERS)</font>

540
01:26:19.408 --> 01:26:21.505
<font color="#D900D9">(GUNSHOT)</font>

